                                        "entry_id": "e451ea4e-8da4-38e0-a23b-f91585b69b16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person from India, varying historically from the entire subcontinent to India north of the Deccan, especially the plains of the Ganges and Jumna."
                                        ],
